    "question": "<p>In the problem, out of the four figures marked (a), (b), (c) and (d) three are similar in a certain manner. However, one figure is not like the other three. Choose the figure which is different from the rest:</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/12/F1_Madhuri_Defence_29.11.2022_D38.png\" style=\"width: 318px; height: 108px;\" /></p>\n",
