    "solution": "",
    "solution_hi": "<p>उपरोक्त प्रश्न में, दूसरा अंक प्राप्त करने के लिए पहली संख्या के साथ निम्नलिखित संक्रियाएं की जाती हैं।</p>\n\n<p>{(पहली संख्या +&nbsp;<span style=\"\">1 )&nbsp;&divide;&nbsp; 2}</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> &nbsp;= दूसरी संख्या</p>\n\n<p><strong>विकल्प 1</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">{(29 + 1) &divide; 2}</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">&nbsp;2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;= ( 30&nbsp;&divide; 2)</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;= 15</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;= 225</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>विकल्प 2</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">{(17&nbsp;+ 1) &divide; 2}</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">&nbsp;2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;= ( 18&nbsp;&divide; 2)</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;= 9</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;= 81</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>विकल्प&nbsp;3</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"\">{(45&nbsp;+ 1) &divide; 2}</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">&nbsp;2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;= ( 46&nbsp;&divide; 2)</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;= 23</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;= 529&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">&ne; 576&nbsp;</span>(समान&nbsp;पैटर्न&nbsp;का अनुसरण&nbsp;नहीं करता है)</p>\n\n<p><strong>विकल्प&nbsp;4</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">{(31&nbsp;+ 1) &divide; 2}</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">&nbsp;2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;= ( 32&nbsp;&divide; 2)</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;= 16</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;= 256</span></p>\n\n<p>इसलिए, केवल 45 : 576 <span style=\"\">समान&nbsp;पैटर्न</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span>का <span style=\"\">अनुसरण&nbsp;</span>नहीं कर रहा है।</p>\n\n<p>अत:, सही उत्तर&nbsp;<strong>45 : 576&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"\">है।</span></p>\n",
